+Added `tests/ci-d3e29f18-mixer-faders-portability-check.py`, registered as CTest
+`CiD3e29f18MixerFadersPortability` in `tests/CMakeLists.txt` and as a fork source in
+`tests/fork-sources.txt`.
+
+The checker extracts the construction and comparison lines from the current
+`MixerSendsOnFadersTest.cpp`, compiles them against **Qt 5** (must succeed) and, when installed,
+against **Qt 6** (must succeed). It also compiles the original Qt 6-only spelling against Qt 5 as a
+negative control and requires the specific `QStringList` / `no matching` diagnostic, so a probe that
+stopped reproducing the defect cannot pass silently. With the old test source the extracted code is
+the old spelling and the checker exits 1; with the fix it exits 0.
